{"work_id":"manohara","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/manohara/scenes/scene-038.md","record_count":50,"records":[{"id":"manohara-s038-d001","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"விஜயா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வாள் முனையால், தன்னுயிரையும் மன்னுயிரையும் காத்திடும் வலிமை வாய்ந்தவர் கடைசியில் தப்பி ஓடி உயிர் பிழைத்தார். எல்லாம் உங்கள் நல்லெண்ணத்தால் வந்த நாசந்தான் அத்தே! அவர் எங்கு சென்றாரோ? எப்படி அலைகிறாரோ!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":59,"printed_page":58}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d002","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"பத்மாவதி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சாப்பிடு விஜயா...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":59,"printed_page":58}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d003","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"விஜயா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வேண்டாம் அத்தே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":59,"printed_page":58}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d004","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"பத்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"கர்ப்பவதி சாப்பிடாமல் இருக்கக் கூடாது. வயிற்றில் வளரும் கருவுக்காகவாவது சாப்பிட்டுத்தானே ஆகவேண்டும்... சாப்பிடு...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":59,"printed_page":58}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d005","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"விஜயா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அத்தே... இந்தக் கஞ்சியா...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":59,"printed_page":58}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d006","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"வ. சே","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அருமையாயிருக்கிறது...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":59,"printed_page":58}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d007","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"தோழி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இந்தப் பழரசம் உடம்பைப் பளபளப்பாக்கும்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":59,"printed_page":58}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d008","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"வ. சே","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"தெரிந்துதானடி இதைத் தேர்ந்தெடுத்தேன், மாலினி! எங்கேயோ ஒரு அழகி இருந்தாளாம்; அவள் மேனியின் மெருகு குலையாமலிருக்க கழுதைப் பாலிலே ஸ்நானம் செய்வாளாம்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":59,"printed_page":58}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d009","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"தோழி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இதென்னம்மா அதிசயம்... நீங்கள் கேட்டால் புருஷோத்தமர் புலிப்பால் கூட கொண்டு வருவாரே...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":59,"printed_page":58}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d010","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"வ. சே","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சந்தேகமென்னடி அதிலே?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":59,"printed_page":58}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d011","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"தோழி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அதிருக்கட்டும்... நீங்கள் இப்படி அலட்சியமாக இருக்கிறீர்களே... மனோகரன் வேறு தப்பிவிட்டான். வசந்தன் முடி சூட்டு விழாவை சீக்கிரம் நடத்திவிட வேண்டாமா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":59,"printed_page":58}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d012","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"வ. சே","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இது என்னடி பெரிய காரியம், வேந்தனின் வேத புத்தகமே நான்தான். வெண்ணிலவை சூரியன் என்றால் அவர் நம்பித்தான் தீருவார்... கவலைப்படாதே! ஒரு கண்ணசைவில் முடிந்துவிடும் வசந்தன் பட்டாபிஷேகம்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":59,"printed_page":58}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d013","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"வைத்தியர்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ராஜாதி ராஜ... ராஜமார்த்தாண்ட...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":59,"printed_page":58}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d014","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"விகடன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ராஜ கம்பீர... ராஜகோலாஹல...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":59,"printed_page":58}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d015","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"வைத்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ராஜவீர தீர பராக்கிரம...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":59,"printed_page":58}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d016","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"விக","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ரணரங்க தீர வீர சூர...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d017","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"வைத்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உப்பில்லாம கலக்கஞ்சி குடிக்கும் வசந்த மகா ராஜா பராக்! பராக்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d018","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"வசந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"தோம்... தோம்... வந்தோம்......","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d019","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"விகடன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வசந்தா! இதோ பாரு... அம்மா திட்டுவாங்க எழுந்திரு... தர்பார் மாதிரியே இருக்கணும்... நான் சொல்றபடி செய்யணும்... உம்... இதிலே உட்காருங்க மகாராஜா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d020","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"விக","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இப்ப நீங்க யாரு?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d021","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"வசந்தன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இப்ப நீங்க யாரு?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d022","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"விக","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"த்ச்...பதில் சொல்லுங்க...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d023","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"த்ச்...பதில் சொல்லுங்க...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d024","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"விக","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அடடா... பதில் சொல்லுங்க, மகாராஜா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d025","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அடடா... பதில் சொல்லுங்க மகாராஜா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d026","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"விக","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பதில் சொல்லணும் “மகாராஜா” அப்படீன்னு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d027","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம்... சரி...சரி... மகாராஜா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d028","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"விக","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ... நான் தான் மந்திரி!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d029","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d030","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"விகட","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இவரு (வைத்தியரைக் காட்டி)","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d031","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"தெரியும்... தெரியும்...... மகாராணி...... வா...வா... உக்கார...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d032","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"விக","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மகாராஜா... அவரு சேனாதிபதி...... இப்ப யாரு மகாராணி?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d033","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"வைத்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அதோ...மாலினியை வைச்சுக்கலாம்...வா...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d034","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"விக","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"(மாலினியைப் பார்த்து) நான் சொல்றபடி கொஞ்சம் கேளேன்... இன்னைக்கு மட்டும் நீ மகாராணி... மகாராஜாவோட போயி உட்காரு...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d035","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"[இளிக்கிறான்]... சபாஷ்....","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d036","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"விகடன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அடுத்து நாட்டு அரசர் யாராவது, சந்தோஷமாக வந்தால் சந்தோஷமாக பேசவேண்டும், கோபமாக வந்தால் கோபமாக பேச வேண்டும்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d037","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சரி!... மந்திரி!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d038","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"விக","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம்—தர்பார் ஆரம்பமாகலாம்....","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d039","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சேனாதிபதி! நடனம் நடக்கட்டும்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":60,"printed_page":59}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d040","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"வைத்தியன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மகாராணியை ஆடச் சொல்லுங்கள்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":61,"printed_page":60}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d041","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"விக","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாம் அரசே! வேற ஆளில்ல பாருங்க... அதனாலே ஆடட்டும்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":61,"printed_page":60}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d042","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம்... ஆடு! நம் நாட்டில் எல்லோரும் சமத்துவம்... எல்லோரும் ஆடலாம்... நடனமாடத் தெரியாதவர்கள் பெண்களே அல்ல! சரிதானே விகடா","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":61,"printed_page":60}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d043","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"விக","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இப்போது பெண்கள் நடப்பதே ஒரு நடனமாதிரிதானே இருக்கு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":61,"printed_page":60}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d044","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஓகோ! அடுத்த நாட்டு அரசரா?... சந்தோஷமாய் வருகிறீரா? கோபமாய் வருகிறீரா?...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":61,"printed_page":60}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d045","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"புருஷோத்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"போதுமடா... சும்மா இரு...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":61,"printed_page":60}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d046","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஓ! கோபமாய் வந்திருக்கிறார்... ஓய்!...மூளையில்லாத ராஜே!... முட்டாள் அரசரே!... எங்கே வந்தீர்? வந்த காரியத்தைச் சொல்லும்... வசந்தனுடைய தர்பாரிலே வரக் காரணம் என்ன?... மந்திரி!... போதுமா கோபம்!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":61,"printed_page":60}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d047","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"அரசர்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஏ, விகடா இது என்னடா கூத்து!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":61,"printed_page":60}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d048","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"விக","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"முடிசூட்டு விழா... ஒத்திகை நடத்திக் காட்டச் சொன்னார்கள் அம்மா!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":61,"printed_page":60}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d049","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"அர","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வைத்தியா! நீ என்ன மருந்து கொடுத்து பைத்தியத்தை தெளிய வைக்கிறாயா இல்லை!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":61,"printed_page":60}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"},{"id":"manohara-s038-d050","scene_id":"manohara-s038","scene_ordinal":38,"transition_audit_id":"T038","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பைத்தியமா?... யார் சொன்னது? இது தீராத வியாதி!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":61,"printed_page":60}],"source_scene_file":"scene-038.md"}]}